  <Document>
    <name>The Negro Motorist Green Book: 1946 - Part 1 of 2 (1900 Listings)</name>
    <description>Google My Maps layer 1/2 (&lt;=2,000 feature limit). Published in 1946 as the first post-World War II edition following the 1942-1945 wartime hiatus, introducing the motto &#x27;Carry your Green Book with you... you may need it&#x27; and expanding to 3,335 listings. Preserved in the Library of Congress collection.</description>
