        <styleUrl>#cat_other</styleUrl>
        <description><![CDATA[<div style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;"><h3 style="margin:0 0 6px 0;color:#6D4C41;">Florida Normal and Industrial Institute</h3><table style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;"><tr><td><b>Edition:</b></td><td>1946</td></tr><tr><td><b>Category:</b></td><td>College (Retail, Services &amp; Other)</td></tr><tr><td><b>Address:</b></td><td>10 N Holmes Blvd.</td></tr><tr><td><b>Location:</b></td><td>St. Augustme, FL, United States</td></tr><tr><td><b>Entry Type:</b></td><td>Listing</td></tr><tr><td><b>Archival Notes:</b></td><td>Initially the Florida Baptist Academy, this is the original location of the Florida Normal and Industrial Institute before merging with the Florida Institute in 1942. In 1968 the new campus opened as Florida Memorial College in Miami Gardens (Opa-locka), which was renamed named the Florida Memorial University in 2004. https://www.fmu.edu/about-fmu/</td></tr></table></div>]]></description>
        <ExtendedData><Data name="Edition"><value>1946</value></Data><Data name="BusinessType"><value>College</value></Data><Data name="CategoryGroup"><value>Retail, Services &amp; Other</value></Data><Data name="OwnerName"><value>Unknown</value></Data><Data name="OwnerGender"><value>Unknown</value></Data><Data name="Address"><value>10 N Holmes Blvd.</value></Data><Data name="City"><value>St. Augustme</value></Data><Data name="State"><value>FL</value></Data><Data name="Country"><value>United States</value></Data><Data name="SourceType"><value>Listing</value></Data><Data name="BookNotes"><value></value></Data><Data name="DataEditorNotes"><value>Initially the Florida Baptist Academy, this is the original location of the Florida Normal and Industrial Institute before merging with the Florida Institute in 1942. In 1968 the new campus opened as Florida Memorial College in Miami Gardens (Opa-locka), which was renamed named the Florida Memorial University in 2004. https://www.fmu.edu/about-fmu/</value></Data></ExtendedData>
